SDL 3.4.x: G923 for PlayStation/PC (046d:c266 native, c267 auto mode switch) in SDL3's lg4ff
HIDAPI driver, and the driver enabled on Android. Apply with: git apply sdl3-lg4ff-g923-android.diff
Base: release-3.4.20 (f00dc91). Not an SDL submission.

